{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39733","headline":"贻宋评事 · 黄滔","name":"贻宋评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河阳城里谢城中，入曳长裾出佩铜。\n燕国金台无别客，陶家柳下有清风。\n数踪篆隶书新得，一竈屯蒙火细红。\n时说三吴欲归处，绿波洲渚紫蒲藂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}